 "hast": "\n<p>Choose the setup that matches your starting point.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"LinkedCard\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;#scaffold-with-create&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;items-start gap-1 p-6 text-sm md:p-6&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;font-medium&#x22;}]\">Use shadcn/create</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground&#x22;}]\"><p>Build your preset and generate a Vite project command.</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"LinkedCard\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;#scaffold-with-cli&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;items-start gap-1 p-6 text-sm md:p-6&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;font-medium&#x22;}]\">Use the CLI</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground&#x22;}]\"><p>Scaffold a new Vite project directly from the terminal.</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"LinkedCard\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;#existing-vite-project&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;items-start gap-1 p-6 text-sm md:p-6&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;font-medium&#x22;}]\">Existing Project</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground&#x22;}]\"><p>Configure shadcn/ui manually in an existing Vite project.</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;id&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;scaffold-with-create&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;scroll-mt-24&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"use-shadcncreate\">Use shadcn/create</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"build-your-preset\">Build Your Preset</h3><p>Open <a href=\"/create?template=vite\">shadcn/create</a> and build your preset visually. Choose your style, colors, fonts, icons, and more.</p><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Button\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;asChild&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;size&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;sm&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Link\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/create?template=vite&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;target&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;_blank&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;rel&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;noopener noreferrer&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 no-underline!&#x22;}]\"><p>Open shadcn/create</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><h3 id=\"create-project\">Create Project</h3><p>Click <code>Create Project</code>, choose your package manager, and copy the generated command.</p><p>The generated command will look similar to this:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE] --template vite\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE] --template vite\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE] --template vite\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE] --template vite\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest init --preset [CODE] --template vite\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --preset</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> [CODE] --template vite</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>The exact command will include your selected options such as <code>--base</code>, <code>--monorepo</code>, or <code>--rtl</code>.</p><h3 id=\"add-components\">Add Components</h3><p>Add the <code>Card</code> component to your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add card\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add card\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add card\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> card</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>If you created a monorepo, run the command from <code>apps/web</code> or specify the workspace from the repo root:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apps/web</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>The command above will add the <code>Card</code> component to your project. You can then import it like this:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/App.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from &#x22;@/components/ui/card&#x22;\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=&#x22;max-w-sm&#x22;>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Project Overview</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>\n          Track progress and recent activity for your Vite app.\n        </CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        Your design system is ready. Start building your next component.\n      </CardContent>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default App\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  Card,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardContent,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardDescription,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardHeader,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardTitle,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">} </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/card\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> App</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">() {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> className</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"max-w-sm\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardHeader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardTitle</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Project Overview</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardTitle</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">          Track progress and recent activity for your Vite app.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardHeader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardContent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        Your design system is ready. Start building your next component.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardContent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  )</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> App</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>If you created a monorepo, update <code>apps/web/src/App.tsx</code> and import from <code>@workspace/ui/components/card</code> instead.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;id&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;scaffold-with-cli&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;scroll-mt-24&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"use-the-cli\">Use the CLI</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"create-project-1\">Create Project</h3><p>Run the <code>init</code> command to scaffold a new Vite project. Follow the prompts to configure your project: base, preset, monorepo, and more.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest init -t vite\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest init -t vite\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest init -t vite\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init -t vite\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest init -t vite\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> -t</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> vite</span></span></code></pre></figure><p><strong>For a monorepo project, use <code>--monorepo</code> flag:</strong></p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest init -t vite --monorepo\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest init -t vite --monorepo\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest init -t vite --monorepo\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init -t vite --monorepo\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest init -t vite --monorepo\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> -t</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> vite</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --monorepo</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"add-components-1\">Add Components</h3><p>Add the <code>Card</code> component to your project:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add card\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add card\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add card\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> card</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>If you created a monorepo, run the command from <code>apps/web</code> or specify the workspace from the repo root:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add card -c apps/web\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> apps/web</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>The command above will add the <code>Card</code> component to your project. You can then import it like this:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/App.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import {\n  Card,\n  CardContent,\n  CardDescription,\n  CardHeader,\n  CardTitle,\n} from &#x22;@/components/ui/card&#x22;\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <Card className=&#x22;max-w-sm&#x22;>\n      <CardHeader>\n        <CardTitle>Project Overview</CardTitle>\n        <CardDescription>\n          Track progress and recent activity for your Vite app.\n        </CardDescription>\n      </CardHeader>\n      <CardContent>\n        Your design system is ready. Start building your next component.\n      </CardContent>\n    </Card>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default App\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  Card,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardContent,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardDescription,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardHeader,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  CardTitle,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">} </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/card\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> App</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">() {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> className</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"max-w-sm\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardHeader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardTitle</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Project Overview</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardTitle</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">          Track progress and recent activity for your Vite app.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardHeader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardContent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        Your design system is ready. Start building your next component.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">CardContent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Card</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  )</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\"> default</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> App</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>If you created a monorepo, update <code>apps/web/src/App.tsx</code> and import from <code>@workspace/ui/components/card</code> instead.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;id&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;existing-vite-project&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;scroll-mt-24&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"existing-project\">Existing Project</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"create-project-2\">Create Project</h3><p>If you need a new Vite project, create one first and select the <strong>React + TypeScript</strong> template. Otherwise, skip this step.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npm create vite@latest\" __npm__=\"npm create vite@latest\" __yarn__=\"yarn create vite@latest\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm create vite@latest\" __bun__=\"bun create vite@latest\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npm</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> create</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> vite@latest</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"add-tailwind-css\">Add Tailwind CSS</h3><p>If your project already has Tailwind CSS configured, skip this step.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\" __npm__=\"npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\" __yarn__=\"yarn add tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm add tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\" __bun__=\"bun add tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npm</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> tailwindcss</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> @tailwindcss/vite</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>Replace everything in <code>src/index.css</code> with the following:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/index.css</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"@import &#x22;tailwindcss&#x22;;\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"tailwindcss\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"edit-tsconfigjson-file\">Edit tsconfig.json file</h3><p>If your project already has the <code>@/*</code> alias configured, skip this step.</p><p>Vite splits TypeScript configuration across multiple files. Add the <code>baseUrl</code> and <code>paths</code> properties to the <code>compilerOptions</code> section of <code>tsconfig.json</code> and <code>tsconfig.app.json</code>:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"ts\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">tsconfig.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"ts\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;files&#x22;: [],\n  &#x22;references&#x22;: [\n    {\n      &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;./tsconfig.app.json&#x22;\n    },\n    {\n      &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;./tsconfig.node.json&#x22;\n    }\n  ],\n  &#x22;compilerOptions&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;baseUrl&#x22;: &#x22;.&#x22;,\n    &#x22;paths&#x22;: {\n      &#x22;@/*&#x22;: [&#x22;./src/*&#x22;]\n    }\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"ts\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [],</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">      \"path\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark: