e=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> button</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>The command above will add the <code>Button</code> component to your project. You can then import it like this:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">src/App.tsx</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { Button } from &#x22;@/components/ui/button&#x22;\n\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <div className=&#x22;flex min-h-svh flex-col items-center justify-center&#x22;>\n      <Button>Click me</Button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\nexport default App\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/button\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">function</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#8250DF\"> App</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">() {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> (</span></